### 8.  Counting argument for the whole configuration

> “The triangle \(T_k\) contains  
> \[
> |T_k|=\frac{k(k+1)}2 .
> \tag{3.1}
> \]  
> If we have exactly \(k\) sunny lines, (2.5) yields  
